a. Responsible sales and service of alcoholic beverages;
b. Laws governing the sales and service of alcohol beverages; and
c. Criminal and civil liabilities and consequences for violations of alcoholic beverage laws or ordinances, or for selling or serving alcoholic beverages irresponsibly; or
